      <solution>
        <p>
          We can use the Taylor series for <m>K(z)</m> up to the term in <m>z^2</m> 
          to approximate the period of the pendulum as follows:
        </p>
        <me>
          K(z) \approx p_2(z)=\frac{\pi}{2} + \frac{\pi}{8} z^2
        </me>
        <p>
          Therefore, we have:
        </p>
        <me>
          T \approx 4 \sqrt{\frac{l}{g}}  p_2(x) = 4 \sqrt{\frac{l}{g}} \left( \frac{\pi}{2} + \frac{\pi}{8} \sin^2(\theta_0/2) \right)
        </me>
